<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 19:40:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>KKR 银行举债 5.5 亿欧元支持 Logoplaste 收购</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/kkr-banks-line-up-550-million-of-debt-to-back-logoplaste-buyout</link><description>据知情人士透露，银行已准备提供 5.5 亿欧元（6.035 亿美元）贷款，支持 KKR &amp; Co. 收购包装公司 Logoplaste。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/kkr-banks-line-up-550-million-of-debt-to-back-logoplaste-buyout'&gt;KKR 银行举债 5.5 亿欧元支持 Logoplaste 收购&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：KKR Banks Line Up €550 Million of Debt to Back Logoplaste Buyout&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/kkr-banks-line-up-550-million-of-debt-to-back-logoplaste-buyout</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 17:47:30 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>新西兰准备了解谁可以组建下一届政府</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/new-zealand-poised-to-learn-who-can-form-its-next-government</link><description>新西兰将于周五得知谁有能力组建下一届政府，三周后，选举势均力敌，难以分出胜负。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/new-zealand-poised-to-learn-who-can-form-its-next-government'&gt;新西兰准备了解谁可以组建下一届政府&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：New Zealand Poised to Learn Who Can Form Its Next Government&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/new-zealand-poised-to-learn-who-can-form-its-next-government</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 18:00:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</link><description>在华尔街后期复苏将纳斯达克100指数从熊市边缘拉出来之后，亚洲股市似乎有望小幅上涨，同时对人工智能交易可持续性的持续担忧提振了美国国债。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates'&gt;亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Global Stocks Climb as AI Trade Mounts a Comeback: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 22:10:42 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>由于波动性打击金属，铜价从今年最低点反弹</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/copper-rebounds-from-lowest-this-year-as-volatility-hits-metals</link><description>尽管人们对人工智能繁荣和相关工业金属需求的持久性仍存疑虑，但铜价从 11 个月低点上涨逾 3%，追随科技股的涨幅。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/copper-rebounds-from-lowest-this-year-as-volatility-hits-metals'&gt;由于波动性打击金属，铜价从今年最低点反弹&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Copper Rebounds as Tech Rally Lifts Battered Industrial Metals&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/copper-rebounds-from-lowest-this-year-as-volatility-hits-metals</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:01:10 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>加纳回购11亿美元国内债券以提振信心</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/ghana-buys-back-1-1-billion-domestic-bonds-to-boost-confidence</link><description>加纳提前三个月赎回了四年期国内债券，政府试图增强投资者对经济从债务重组中复苏的信心。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/ghana-buys-back-1-1-billion-domestic-bonds-to-boost-confidence'&gt;加纳回购11亿美元国内债券以提振信心&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Ghana Buys Back $1.1 Billion Domestic Bonds to Boost Confidence&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/ghana-buys-back-1-1-billion-domestic-bonds-to-boost-confidence</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 19:31:46 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>